Funding-Text = {The Kimberley Climate Adaptation Project (KCAP) was a yearlong community
   engagement process looking at local climate change impacts and response
   options for the City of Kimberley, and was funded by the Columbia Basin
   Trust as part of the CBT's Communities Adapting to Climate Change
   initiative.The CALP pilot component of the Kimberley Climate Adaptation
