   Jari, Ivan, Univ Paris Saclay, CNRS, AgroParisTech, Ecol Soc Evolut, Gif Sur Yvette, France.
   Jari, Ivan, Czech Acad Sci, Inst Hydrobiol, Biol Ctr, Ceske Budejovice, Czech Republic.
